# Analects Book 12 (顏淵) — draft, second half: lemmata 29–54 = passages 12.12–12.24 (UNITS_B[0] is lemma 29).
# Token format as the pilot:
#   tokens separated by " | "; a token is  CHARS[PUNCT][=pinyin][/context gloss[//char gloss//char gloss]]
#   a leading "^" breaks the verse line before the token.
# Punctuation is editorial (the edition has none) and always trails the word before it.
# Pinyin defaults to the glossary's first reading; every polyphone states its reading here, and so does
# every bound compound and every character not yet in the glossary.
# Passages follow Zhu Xi's chapters (he prints 片言折獄 and 子路無宿諾 as one chapter, as does the chapter tagging
# of the Ruan witness's transcription): 12.12 = units 29–30, 12.13 = 31, 12.14 = 32, 12.15 = 33,
# 12.16 = 34, 12.17 = 35, 12.18 = 36, 12.19 = 37, 12.20 = 38–43, 12.21 = 44–46, 12.22 = 47–52, 12.23 = 53,
# 12.24 = 54. The last lemma (論語卷六) is a running head and has no unit.
# Quotation marks balance within every unit. Where speech runs on past one of Zhu Xi's comments (12.20
# units 42–43 after 41; 12.21 unit 46 after 45; 12.22 unit 52 after 51) the continuation is left unquoted,
# Chinese and English alike (as Books 8–11). Quotes inside a quote: 『』 in w, ‘’ in l and i (unit 50).
# Repeats: 12.15 = 6.25 (Zhu Xi: 重出) without 君子 — English and token glosses from 6.25, subject 'one';
# 12.22 舉直錯諸枉 = 2.19 wording ('Raise the straight, set aside the many crooked'; i 'Raise up the upright
# and set aside all the crooked'); 舞雩 'the rain-dance terrace' as 11.25; 由 written Yóu as Book 11.
# Readings decided:
#   折 zhé (29, 之舌反); 與 yú question particle (29, 46 ×3; 平聲); 宿 sù 'to keep overnight' (30; Zhu Xi 留也);
#   行 xíng (32 'to carry out'; 43 'conduct' — Zhu Xi 去聲 xìng, modern xíng, note says so, as 11.2);
#   約 yuē, 弗 fú, 畔 pàn, 夫 fú exclamation (33, as 6.25); 惡 è 'bad, evil' (34, 46 ×2);
#   帥 shuài (35); 殺 shā 'to kill' (37 ×2); 道 dào (37 ×2: 無道/有道 'those without/with the Way');
#   焉 yān 'what, how' (37, 於䖍反); 上 shàng, Zhu Xi = 尚 'to add, lay on' (37); 偃 yǎn 'to lie flat' (37);
#   夫 fú 'now' opening a topic (42, 43; 音扶), fū in 夫子 (50); 好 hào (42, 去聲); 下 xià verb 'to put below'
#   (42; 去聲 = modern xià); 從 cóng (44; unmarked here); 慝 tè (44, 46; 吐得反); 朝 zhāo (46, 一朝 'one
#   morning'); 知 zhì 'wisdom' (47 問知, 50; Zhu Xi 上知字去聲下同), zhī 'to know' (47 知人); 錯 cuò (49, 50);
#   見 jiàn 'to see' (50 見子夏), xiàn 'to present oneself' (50 見於夫子; Zhu Xi 賢遍反, as 3.24);
#   鄉 xiàng = 嚮 'a while ago' (50, 去聲); 選 xuǎn (52 ×2; Zhu Xi 息戀反 xuàn, modern xuǎn, note says so);
#   陶 yáo in 臯陶 (52, 音遙); 遠 yuǎn (52 ×2; Zhu Xi 如字, not the verb yuàn); 告 gào (53; Zhu Xi 工毒反
#   gù, modern gào, note says so); 道 dǎo 'to guide' (53; Zhu Xi 去聲, = 導); 曾 zēng (54); 為 wéi (37 為政).
# Glyphs kept as printed: 徳 (37, 44, 46), 臯 (52), 㑹 (54), 衆 (52), 脩 (44, 46), 盜 (36).
